nr < H and 0 <= nc < W:\n                            if grid[nr][nc] == 1 and (nr, nc) not in comp:\n                                stack.append((nr, nc))\n                            elif (nr, nc) in holes:\n                                touches_hole = True\n                                \n                visited_1.update(comp)\n                if touches_hole:\n                    for cr, cc in comp:\n                        output_grid[cr][cc] = 8\n                        \n    return output_grid",
